-- `Shape for x` finds the records of Shape whose one reference field takes x (Reference §10).
-- Here no field of Loan takes what follows `for`, and the compiler accepts both refinements.
--
-- LabelledMember counts the loans for a text: `tag` names each value of `tags`, and no field
-- of Loan holds a text. LoanOfLoan counts the loans for a loan, and Loan has no field that
-- holds a Loan. `exists Loan for ...` with the same subject is refused with V13, "'for'
-- matches 0 fields of 'Loan'"; a collection source written `Loan for ...` is not checked.
--
-- At runtime the first fails with "'for' target is not an instance" and the second with
-- "'Loan for this' names no one field of 'Loan' typed with 'Loan' (validator gap, V13)"
-- (`bindingCandidates` and `instancesReferencing` in `compiler/src/main/kotlin/velle/Evaluator.kt`).
act Member {
    name: text
    tags: many text
}

act Loan {
    member: one Member
    dueOn: Date
}

shape LabelledMember = Member where count(tags as tag where count(Loan for tag) > 0) > 0

shape LoanOfLoan = Member where count(Loan for (Loan for this)) > 0
